                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Great little breakfast place in Xinyi. Not very big, so it might be difficult to find a seat during rush hours. English menu available, and ordering via QR  code was very easy. You can’t pay online though. Delicious radish cakes, pancakes and sandwiches. Decent coffee as well. Don’t miss it if you are in the area, or just got tired of the breakfast buffet at your hotel.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
